{"id": "section-body-16256", "title": "Nose Bleeding (Epistaxis)", "chapterId": "chapter-fifteen", "tocLevel": 4, "tocPath": ["APPROACH TO PATIENTS WITH EMERGENCY CONDITIONS", "EAR, NOSE AND THROAT/HEAD AND NECK DISEASES", "Other Conditions of the Nose", "Nose Bleeding (Epistaxis)"], "blocks": [{"id": "body-16256", "type": "heading", "style": "Heading4", "text": "Nose Bleeding (Epistaxis)", "runs": [{"text": "Nose"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Bleeding"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "(Epistaxis)"}], "level": 4, "list": {"level": 2, "numberingId": "1219"}}, {"id": "body-16257", "type": "paragraph", "style": "BodyText", "text": "Nose bleeding is a condition which is common in adults. It may be due to a local cause in the nasal cavity (e.g., trauma, tumor, foreign body, septal varices, or septal deviation); or a systemic cause (e.g., blood disorders, vascular disorders, renal failure, hepatic failure, or use of anticoagulants (warfarin, heparin). Most cases of epistaxis are minor; do not require hospitalization. Patients with significant nose bleeding do require hospitalization.", "runs": [{"text": "Nose"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "bleeding"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "is"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "a"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "condition"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "which"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "is"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "common"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "in"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "adults."}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "It"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "may"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "be"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "due"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "to"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "a"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "local"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "cause"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "in"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "the"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "nasal"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "cavity"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "(e.g.,"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "trauma,"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "tumor, foreign body, septal varices, or septal deviation); or a systemic cause (e.g., blood disorders, vascular disorders, renal failure, hepatic failure, or use of anticoagulants (warfarin, heparin). Most cases of epistaxis are minor; do not require hospitalization. Patients with significant nose bleeding do require hospitalization."}]}, {"id": "body-16259", "type": "heading", "style": "Heading4", "text": "Non-Pharmacological Management", "runs": [{"text": "Non-Pharmacological"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Management"}], "level": 4}, {"id": "body-16260", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Stabilize the patient: put an open intravenous line, do blood grouping and cross matching", "runs": [{"text": "Stabilize"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "the"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "patient:"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "put"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "an"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "open"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "intravenous"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "line,"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "do"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "blood"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "grouping"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "and"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "cross"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "matching"}], "list": {"level": 0, "numberingId": "1176"}}, {"id": "body-16261", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Put the patient in a sitting position and advise the patient to pinch the soft part of the nose gently for 5minutes", "runs": [{"text": "Put"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "the"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "patient"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "in"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "a"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "sitting"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "position"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "and"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "advise"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "the"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "patient"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "to"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "pinch"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "the"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "soft"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "part"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "of"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "the"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "nose"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "gently"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "for"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "5minutes"}], "list": {"level": 0, "numberingId": "1176"}}, {"id": "body-16262", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Put on a gown, glasses, head light and sterile gloves and evacuate clots. Do a thorough head and neck examination", "runs": [{"text": "Put"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "on"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "a"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "gown,"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "glasses,"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "head"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "light"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "and"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "sterile"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "gloves"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "and"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "evacuate"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "clots."}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Do"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "a"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "thorough"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "head"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "and"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "neck"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "examination"}], "list": {"level": 0, "numberingId": "1176"}}, {"id": "body-16263", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Cauterize septal varisces (if any) using a silver nitrate pencil", "runs": [{"text": "Cauterize"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "septal"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "varisces"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "(if"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "any)"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "using"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "a"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "silver"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "nitrate"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "pencil"}], "list": {"level": 0, "numberingId": "1176"}}, {"id": "body-16264", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Do an anterior nasal packing by introducing into the nasal cavity as far posterior as possible sterile Vaseline gauzes (or iodine-soaked gauzes if not available) or special merocele pack, using a dissecting forceps (if bayonet forceps is not available)", "runs": [{"text": "Do an anterior"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "nasal"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "packing by introducing into the nasal"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "cavity as far"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "posterior"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "as possible sterile Vaseline gauzes (or"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "iodine-soaked gauzes if"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "not"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "available)"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "or"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "special"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "merocele pack, using a dissecting forceps"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "(if"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "bayonet"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "forceps"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "is not available)"}], "list": {"level": 0, "numberingId": "1176"}}, {"id": "body-16265", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Put rolled dry gauze on the columella and plaster it", "runs": [{"text": "Put"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "rolled"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "dry"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "gauze"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "on"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "the"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "columella"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "and"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "plaster"}, {"text": " it"}], "list": {"level": 0, "numberingId": "1176"}}, {"id": "body-16266", "type": "paragraph", "style": "BodyText", "text": "If the patient is still bleeding", "runs": [{"text": "If"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "the"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "patient"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "is"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "still"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "bleeding"}]}, {"id": "body-16268", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Perform a Flexible nasoendoscopy", "runs": [{"text": "Perform"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "a"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Flexible"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "nasoendoscopy"}], "list": {"level": 0, "numberingId": "1176"}}, {"id": "body-16269", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Do a posterior nasal packing using a Foley’s catheter introduced through the nasal cavity into the oropharynx, balloon it with normal saline up to 10–15cc while pulling it outward to impinge on the posterior nasal choana, then do anterior nasal packing as above.", "runs": [{"text": "Do a posterior nasal packing using a Foley’s catheter"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "introduced"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "through"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "the"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "nasal"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "cavity"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "into the oropharynx, balloon it with normal saline up to"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "10–15cc"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "while"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "pulling"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "it"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "outward"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "to"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "impinge"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "on the posterior nasal choana, then do anterior nasal packing as above."}], "list": {"level": 0, "numberingId": "1176"}}, {"id": "body-16270", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "\nPlace a posterior nasal pack under general anaesthesia (GA)", "runs": [{"text": "\n"}, {"text": "Place a posterior nasal pack under general anaesthesia (GA)"}], "list": {"level": 0, "numberingId": "1176"}}, {"id": "body-16271", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Put dry gauze on the nose to prevent necrosis of the columella and fix the catheter on the nose with an umbilical clamp", "runs": [{"text": "Put"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "dry"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "gauze"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "on"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "the"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "nose"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "to"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "prevent"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "necrosis"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "of the columella and fix the catheter on the nose with an umbilical clamp"}], "list": {"level": 0, "numberingId": "1176"}}, {"id": "body-16272", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Almost all of the nasal bleedings will be controlled by this way", "runs": [{"text": "Almost all of the nasal bleedings will be controlled by this way"}], "list": {"level": 0, "numberingId": "1176"}}, {"id": "body-16275-textbox1-00001", "type": "paragraph", "style": "BodyText", "text": "Note: Remove the packs after 72 hours", "runs": [{"text": "Note:", "bold": true}, {"text": " ", "bold": true}, {"text": "Remove"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "the"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "packs"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "after"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "72"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "hours"}]}, {"id": "body-16276", "type": "heading", "style": "Heading4", "text": "Pharmacological Management", "runs": [{"text": "Pharmacological"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Management"}], "level": 4}, {"id": "body-16277", "type": "paragraph", "style": "BodyText", "text": "To prevent rhinosinusitis", "runs": [{"text": "To"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "prevent"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "rhinosinusitis"}]}, {"id": "body-16278", "type": "paragraph", "style": "BodyText", "text": "Prophylactic antibiotics are not routinely recommended unless there is evidence of infection or high risk of rhinosinusitis", "runs": [{"text": "Prophylactic"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "antibiotics"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "are"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "not"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "routinely"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "recommended"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "unless"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "there"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "is"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "evidence"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "of"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "infection"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "or"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "high"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "risk"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "of"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "rhinosinusitis"}]}, {"id": "body-16279", "type": "table", "rows": [{"cells": [{"blocks": [{"id": "body-16279-r1-c1-00002", "type": "paragraph", "style": "TableParagraph", "text": "Indication", "runs": [{"text": "Indication", "bold": true}]}], "colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "column": 0}, {"blocks": [{"id": "body-16279-r1-c2-00002", "type": "paragraph", "style": "TableParagraph", "text": "Medicine", "runs": [{"text": "Medicine", "bold": true}]}], "colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "column": 1}, {"blocks": [{"id": "body-16279-r1-c3-00002", "type": "paragraph", "style": "TableParagraph", "text": "Population", "runs": [{"text": "Population", "bold": true}]}], "colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "column": 2}, {"blocks": [{"id": "body-16279-r1-c4-00002", "type": "paragraph", "style": "TableParagraph", "text": "Dose", "runs": [{"text": "Dose", "bold": true}]}], "colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "column": 3}, {"blocks": [{"id": "body-16279-r1-c5-00002", "type": "paragraph", "style": "TableParagraph", "text": "Frequency", "runs": [{"text": "Frequency", "bold": true}]}], "colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "column": 4}, {"blocks": [{"id": "body-16279-r1-c6-00002", "type": "paragraph", "style": "TableParagraph", "text": "Duration", "runs": [{"text": "Duration", "bold": true}]}], "colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "column": 5}], "header": false}, {"cells": [{"blocks": [{"id": "body-16279-r2-c1-00004", "type": "paragraph", "style": "TableParagraph", "text": "Bacterial Infection", "runs": [{"text": "Bacterial Infection"}]}], "colspan": 1, "rowspan": 4, "column": 0}, {"blocks": [{"id": "body-16279-r2-c2-00003", "type": "paragraph", "style": "TableParagraph", "text": "B: amoxicillin + clavulanic Acid (FDC) (PO)", "runs": [{"text": "B:", "bold": true}, {"text": " ", "bold": true}, {"text": "amoxicillin"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "+"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "clavulanic"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Acid (FDC) (PO)"}]}], "colspan": 1, "rowspan": 3, "column": 1}, {"blocks": [{"id": "body-16279-r2-c3-00002", "type": "paragraph", "style": "TableParagraph", "text": "Adults", "runs": [{"text": "Adults"}]}], "colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "column": 2}, {"blocks": [{"id": "body-16279-r2-c4-00002", "type": "paragraph", "style": "TableParagraph", "text": "625 mg – 1 g", "runs": [{"text": "625"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "mg"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "–"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "1"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "g"}]}], "colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "column": 3}, {"blocks": [{"id": "body-16279-r2-c5